(2) Except as mentioned in subsection (3L a contributory is not entitled to a winding up petition unless (a} the number of members is reduced to less than two; or {b) the shares in respect of which he is a contributory, or some of them, were originally allotted to him, or have been held by him, and in his name, for at least 6 months during the 18 months before the commencement of the winding up, or have devolved on him through the death of a former holder.

